type: dataset
title: "Fractured Adelic Geometry"
abstract: "A Foundational Framework for the Birch and Swinnerton-Dyer Conjecture. A monograph in four volumes bound as one, a self-contained research subject of the Grothendieckian Programme: a category of Frobenius–Arakelov–Prismatic spaces, the Master Identity as the agreement of two trivialisations of one determinant line, a proved conditional descent to the classical statements, and a register of conjectures and obstructions with an attack programme. The Birch and Swinnerton-Dyer conjecture remains open."
